<title>THAILAND: Bangchak invests in Auchan hypermarket.</title>
<headline>Bangchak invests in Auchan hypermarket.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc will invest in a 1.34 billion baht ($51.5 million) hypermarket venture in northern Thailand with French retailer Auchan SA Co Ltd, Bangchak said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The company said it had reached agreement with Auchan and Thailand's S&amp;P Group Co Ltd to take a 10 percent stake in a hypermarket project under construction in the northern Thai city of Chiang Mai.</p>
</text>
